The following initial observations are made on the basis of: 

Two briefings by Col. King
                                and [name not declassified], 27 and 28
                                August 1953;

One meeting with CWH and CPP in
                                    DD/P’s office, 2 September
                                1953;

Study of basic paper of P/A (CCN
                                #73844–a 5/6 1952);

Study of NIE–84, dated 19 May 1953;

Study of sundry papers for “background”;

Debriefing of chief field case officer (KS);

Sundry conferences with King and [name not
